te $t(x,y):$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}t(x,y)&=\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x^{2} + 2 x y + y^{2} - 3 y + 15)\\,i-\\frac{∂}{∂x}(x^{2} + 2 x y + y^{2} - 3 y + 15)\\,j\\\\&=(2 x + 2 y - 3)\\,i-(2 x + 2 y)\\,j\\end{aligned}$$\n\nSince our tangent vector needs to be perpendicular to $j$, we must have $t\\cdot j=0.$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}t(x,y)\\cdot j&=0\\\\- 2 x - 2 y&=0\\\\y&=-x\\end{aligned}$$\n\nSubstituting $y=-x$ into the equation of our curve gives:\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}1(x+(-x))^{2}-3(-x)-(-15)&=0\\\\3x-(-15)&=0\\\\3x&=-15\\\\x&=-5\\end{aligned}$$\n\nFinally, the corresponding point is $(-5,5)$." 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521864 1075 #edb/ref 17592186521824 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521864 1075 #edb/ref 17592186521857 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521864 1076 #edb/ref 17592186408166 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521864 1077 "II" 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521864 1078 #edb/ref 17592186521824 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521864 1079 #uuid "e9e874dd-4e18-58ae-af29-7f29c7c49fd9" 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521865 1080 "true" 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521865 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521865 1083 #uuid "ea7623f8-926b-589d-b4d2-d244bf6811a2" 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521866 1080 "true" 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521866 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521866 1083 #uuid "edb2237f-9c3e-58da-8879-ad909ca56f97" 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521867 1080 "false" 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521867 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521867 1083 #uuid "ee1f00c6-1b40-51e8-8084-53cf529cfa21" 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521868 1075 #edb/ref 17592186521757 13194139535598 17592186045443 true] [17592186521868 1075 #edb/ref 17592186521794 13194139535598 175921